		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Elemental master of winds. Hazy blue humanoids made of air, tasked by the gods with controlling the skies. Love music in all forms.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 19, <strong>HP</strong> 54, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 spear (close/near) +8 (2d6) or 3 lightning blast (far) +8 (2d10), <strong>MV</strong> far (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +5, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Unless in contact with dirt or earth, only damaged by magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Regenerate</strong>. Unless in contact with dirt or earth, regains 2d6 HP on its turn.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wind Form</strong>. Unless in contact with dirt or earth, turn into wind.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
